<title>UK: Dresdner sets call warrants on Gold. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Dresdner sets call warrants on Gold. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said it has issued 200,000 European-style call warrants on gold.</p>
<p>(Corrects amount from 200,000 million).</p>
<p>One warrant controls one ounce of gold.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $350			PREMIUM	7.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $17			 GEARING	20.04 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   28.MAY.98		 PAYDATE	22.MAY.97</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $340.75</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
